# Snake App Website — Docs & Consistency

Static marketing site for **Snake App** (Chingalo Family). Keep HTML/CSS and `docs/` aligned with the product and brand.

## Scope
- Site root: `index.html`, `privacy.html`, `css/`, `js/`, `assets/`
- Docs: `docs/` (see `docs/README.md`)
- Companion Flutter app: sibling repo **`snake_app`** (not in this tree)

## Required when finishing a change
1. Review intentional diffs only
2. Keep **relative** markdown links in `docs/` working
3. Sync docs in the **same change set** when any of the following change:
   - Site copy, hero/feature claims, privacy policy wording
   - Brand tokens, fonts, or visual direction
   - Contact details (phone, WhatsApp, Instagram)
   - Screenshots or screenshot order / captions
   - Marketed product facts (level count, modes, platforms, offline/profile, controls, store status)

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| Product story / facts | `docs/ABOUT.md` (+ landing copy if needed) |
| Pages, assets, deploy | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| Nav / journeys / shot order | `docs/FLOW.md` |
| Colors, type, screenshots | `docs/DESIGN.md` |
| Index of docs | `docs/README.md` |
| Project overview | `README.md` |

## Product claim guardrails
- Offline-first; profile gates **saving**, not play
- Do **not** invent Play Store / App Store URLs — use placeholders / coming soon until real
- Align greens with `#0B1F1A` / `#1FA87A` / `#3ECF98`; avoid purple-indigo defaults
- When app-side facts change and this repo is available beside `snake_app`, update website `docs/` to match

## Skill
Prefer `.cursor/skills/snake-app-website-docs/` when editing site copy or docs.
